{"3691310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wake Explorer", "steam_appid": 3691310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an employee of a faceless corporation named W.A.K.E.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dropped on an alien ocean world with one directive: Explore. Why? You don’t know. You just follow orders, printed coldly from a terminal in your cabin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, Upgrade, and Uncover the Unknown</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a vast, procedurally generated world from the deck of your drone ship in this top-down exploration game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛥️ <strong>15 Unique Ships</strong> – Each with distinct strengths, upgradeable stats, and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 <strong>Endless Procedural Maps</strong> – No two expeditions are the same. Discover shifting biomes, colourful terrain and hidden buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏗️ <strong>Upgradeable Buildings</strong> – Find Research Stations to enhance ship capabilities and Harbor's to unlock more powerful vessels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔧 <strong>Persistent Progression</strong> – Earn Coins, Research Points, and rare Sub-nautical Data to continually improve your fleet and efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 <strong>Objective System</strong> – Complete your mapping assignments to progress to new planets, unlocking new ships and technologies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📈 <strong>Highscores &amp; Endless Levels</strong> – Compete, improve, and push deeper into uncharted waters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not told the reasons. Only the results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the orders. Expand your fleet. Dive deeper</p><p class=